UUID: 47725cfc-acb8-3419-b22e-dd4896eb9b0d
Includes the shares of resudial attributes produced in Europe in 2014 with the different technologies.
Location: undefined
Technology: undefined
Time period: Time of publications.
Production volume: na
Sampling: &lt;null&gt;
Extrapolations: &lt;null&gt;
